+# Corpus fetch: rate limit and mirrors
+
+Per-domain rate limit the fetch had to respect: **12 visits per 60 s window per
+domain**, with a **900 s cooldown** imposed after a breach.
+
+Hosts used to fetch the files:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` (primary; also the only host recorded in the
+  `manifest.tsv` header for this corpus)
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>` (mirror)
+- `cdn.statically.io` (mirror; slow / prone to timeouts)
+
+Source: observed from this project's own session transcripts, not re-derived
+or guessed for this file.
